/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 49 0 R
/E (Project EVT Evolution proposes a dual-pronged response: the aggressive automation of low-value administrative friction points, and the simultaneous re-deployment of human capital into high-value, experience-driven creative roles. Supported by a Discounted Cash Flow model projecting $120M in annual staff savings at full implementation, the initiative delivers a positive NPV against a WACC of 7.50% and a discounted payback period of two years, confirming both financial viability and strategic alignment with EVT's guest-centric mission.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
